OL,3,AAI data centres are booming in
OL,4,AAustralia - but at what cost?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sheer size and noise of data
OL,7,Fcentres are what people tend to notice
OL,8,Ffirst. Some say they sound like a jet
OL,9,Fplane about to take off, others
OL,10,Fcomplain of a high-pitched whine.
OL,12,FWhen Lucy* puts her child to bed, she
OL,13,Fhears a constant humming. "I'll hear it
OL,14,Fand think, 'What is that? What is going
OL,15,Fon?'," she says.
OL,17,FAnd then she'll remember that the noise
OL,18,Fis a data centre just 350m (0.2 miles)
OL,19,Ffrom her front door in the desirable
OL,20,Fsuburb of Lane Cove, in Sydney's lower
OL,21,Fnorth-shore. Another four are in the
OL,22,Fpipeline at the local industrial park.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
