OL,3,ARussell Howard 'devastated' after his
OL,4,Ababy son died hours after birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FHoward praised the "extraordinary
OL,7,Fcompassion, kindness and humanity" of
OL,8,Fthe hospital staff who cared for them
OL,9,Fover the period that followed Felix's
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
